"file_name": "com.NEKR_VR.EduVR (7).png", "id": "1119879959572013", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982557_1119879962905346_3257633798623217793_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6ZMhziOFBiAQ7kNvwFHD7oQ&_nc_oc=Ado5kVAPqQwXH5LhFBDggqTPUKJGRUWhUMSBEXrANynBSt82SafWpTsbvea20nMCCYY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQvaPdsvRDf2ywzS5NBqbaqLwYRQqAUwhYHJcsC6k-B9Q&oe=6AFC91E8"}, {"file_name": "com.NEKR_VR.EduVR (9).png", "id": "600769042344423", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75367595_600769045677756_4184331693265155160_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SQtCXSCg_8oQ7kNvwGI8oOG&_nc_oc=AdpKUJ2tqgyazWFquIGbOGrTCJ0LGpubNEwR81_WsYlWQ7fYBY3dnuOPy9cXw8UV60w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQCRt5Md9JoDLPiNb0Pt8IdpE_CJoceXylMVLpoiruDUg&oe=6AFC6A2F"}, {"file_name": "com.NEKR_VR.EduVR (5).png", "id": "511803525221127", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031608_511803535221126_6449582359268280911_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n-DJ1JVDq8wQ7kNvwEm2maa&_nc_oc=Adry1T3SVKxboZaRtFwYJGWwAXspf71H7OPDIaNCFRb5TjPCt2yDJH9hIrkaufRbX_M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSrHGT_y5WITAjnWiFWZkNLS4eQC-KdoiU8M0BC7zF-2g&oe=6AFC6E98"}, {"file_name": "com.NEKR_VR.EduVR (6).png", "id": "1380952959552847", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003258_1380952966219513_7539545808247244132_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_KpkOg3rG1YQ7kNvwG2dGOJ&_nc_oc=Adq1DhrC5oWv73t9N71d6L_agY26JeNNouDqYxOoCkKnocKRhVY4f-Zs5Yjg1L76vWg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQHXEsUrtqvhmBvhcMzSQTSkwSuBsmWY_I_uYlanNwSTg&oe=6AFC7BFC"}, {"file_name": "com.NEKR_VR.EduVR (10).png", "id": "2014764132301448", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75451776_2014764135634781_3715488626808879103_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E8h2Qo8hi6cQ7kNvwFoqVhT&_nc_oc=Adq-dldTCrW2Ty6HMULwoSZkarWHqelE87QbAANMDMY4H2gGLK3BPv3Oq13yYlfH7Go&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRcWMXD9wRFqjOHlZgdoZUA7c2dbiSoQvOrsaKQZqg0XA&oe=6AFC866B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "593570069731482", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974502_593570076398148_755855805457355311_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LYLRUhVqBZsQ7kNvwESPm74&_nc_oc=Adod6hun9B5Uu0Hw6c4fm_PudHQ2E8KcScUMnfkIEXwNgzMTIWDmyOH6svOFV1984BA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRRc-pl_3YR40xfLXkzuvZLp1KQ721s424e0LkKdMpVwQ&oe=6AFC7590"}, "display_name": "EduVR", "keywords": ["education", "school", "workshop", "modern"], "long_description": "## Revolutionizing Education with Virtual Reality  \n\n**EduVR** is a modular educational VR application designed for schools, offering a new way to engage students in learning. Teachers and students become part of realistic simulations and practical tasks that promote active learning, safe experimentation, and a better understanding of complex topics.  \n\n---\n\n## **Key Features**  \n\n- **Modular System:** Covers a wide range of subjects and disciplines, with new modules regularly added.  \n- **Easy to Use:** No need for a powerful PC \u2013 EduVR runs directly on Meta Quest.  \n- **Safe Learning:** Simulate situations that can't be safely performed in traditional classrooms (e.g., safety training).  \n- **Interactive:** 5\u201310 minute tasks and simulations, ideal for integration into regular lessons.  \n- **Progress Tracking:** Teachers can monitor students\u2019 progress and provide personalized feedback.  \n\n---\n\n## **Benefits for Schools**  \n\n- **Engaging Lessons:** Virtual reality increases students\u2019 interest in learning and enhances their skills.  \n- **Cost Savings:** Vocational schools can simulate working with expensive materials and equipment.  \n- **Flexibility:** Adaptable to different subjects and age groups.  \n- **Practical Applications:** Prepares students for real-life scenarios in a safe and efficient way.  \n\n---\n\n## **Try it for Free**  \n\nDownload the free version of EduVR and access a new module every 14 days. Discover how EduVR can transform education at your school and get started today!  ", "short_description": "Transform your classroom with EduVR, the modular educational VR app designed for schools! Engage students in interactive lessons across various subjects with realistic simulations, hands-on tasks, and detailed feedback. No PC required\u2014run it directly on your Meta Quest. Discover a new way to learn, save resources, and spark interest in every student!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/c798cbdb-09be-4657-9222-0179dc129c86", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NEKR VR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://eduvr.cz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "cs"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24436333162660346"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": 